{'symbol': 'COG', 'date': '2021-09-08 16:15:00', 'title': 'CABOT OIL & GAS COMMENCES PRIVATE EXCHANGE OFFERS AND CIMAREX ENERGY COMMENCES CONSENT SOLICITATIONS', 'text': 'HOUSTON, SEPT. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CABOT OIL & GAS CORPORATION (NYSE: COG) ("CABOT") AND CIMAREX ENERGY CO. (NYSE: XEC) ("CIMAREX") \xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT, IN CONNECTION WITH THE\xa0ANTICIPATED MERGER OF CIMAREX AND A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF CABOT, CABOT HAS COMMENCED OFFERS TO ELIGIBLE HOLDERS (AS DEFINED HEREIN) TO EXCHANGE (EACH AN "EXCHANGE OFFER" AND COLLECTIVELY, THE "EXCHANGE OFFERS") ANY AND ALL OUTSTANDING NOTES ISSUED BY CIMAREX AS SET FORTH IN THE TABLE BELOW (THE\xa0"EXISTING CIMAREX NOTES") FOR (1) UP TO $2,000,000,000 AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF NEW NOTES ISSUED BY CABOT (THE "NEW CABOT NOTES") AND (2) CASH.'}